        "ascending: distinct tags, each ranking above every tag before it (semver 2.0 precedence without build metadata).",
        "noCopy: tags of ascending that are valid releases but get no docs copy (alpha, beta, rc shapes other than rc.N). Every other tag of ascending is a copy tag (vX.Y.Z or vX.Y.Z-rc.N), the only shape the jq program accepts.",
        "pairs: named cases with the expected order of a against b (-1 below, 0 equal, 1 above).",
